1
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:46,319
No, don't.

2
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:58,319
The VIP is moving on to the next event.

3
00:01:58,319 --> 00:02:00,120
They already know our room location.

4
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,599
Got it. I know what to do.

5
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:03,680
Hello, room service.

6
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,960
Hello, here's the fruit platter you ordered.

7
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:14,840
Thanks.

8
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:20,319
If they're planning an assassination,

9
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:22,039
would they poison it?

10
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:24,680
Very likely.

11
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,199
According to protocol,

12
00:02:26,319 --> 00:02:28,080
there needs to be a taste test.

13
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,639
Even though this is a drill,

14
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,560
we still have to follow the rules.

15
00:02:32,479 --> 00:02:33,879
It's not poisoned. Go ahead and eat.

16
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:56,479
Do I really have to swim?

17
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:57,919
Can you swim?

18
00:02:58,439 --> 00:03:00,919
I can, but if a bullet hits me,

19
00:03:00,919 --> 00:03:02,080
wouldn't that really hurt?

20
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,759
Don't worry about that.

21
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:05,639
We've installed surveillance everywhere.

22
00:03:05,919 --> 00:03:06,919
Plus, in the pool,

23
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:08,080
we've set up an infrared system.

24
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,599
If anyone enters or leaves,

25
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:10,759
or if anything is out of place,

26
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:11,960
we'll detect it immediately.

27
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,800
Let's go inside and check the monitors first.

28
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,439
Okay.

29
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,439
It's safe inside.

30
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:33,159
Go on in.

31
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,360
All the surveillance on Anda inside...

32
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,759
...can just be handled by me alone.

33
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,400
All right.

34
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,360
I'll wait for Anda here then.

35
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:57,000
The plan failed.

36
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,120
The accessible area is fully under their control.

37
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,759
Move to the next open area.

38
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,319
Copy that.

39
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:25,439
Don't worry.

40
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,560
Today's just like a vacation.

41
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,920
Just relax and have fun.

42
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,720
Let's go.

43
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,720
Go ahead.

44
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:04,759
An enemy's infiltrated the kitchen.

45
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:06,839
Keep eyes on him.

46
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:10,319
The rest of the route is all open area.

47
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:11,480
Roger that.

48
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,560
That'll do.

49
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,439
Thanks.

50
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:58,480
You're welcome.

51
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,279
It's poisoned.

52
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,519
Too much wasabi.

53
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,800
See if you can eat it.

54
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,519
I thought you were bored,

55
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,879
just amusing yourself.

56
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,399
I really wasn't just amusing myself.

57
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:41,160
Meat pies!

58
00:06:41,759 --> 00:06:42,720
I was stuck in the car

59
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,879
without a bite to eat.

60
00:06:45,199 --> 00:06:46,800
Don't choke, don't choke.

61
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,759
Slow down.

62
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:50,079
So delicious. Uncle Qu is the best.

63
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:52,920
See? Choking already, aren't you?

64
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:56,519
Was there anything over on their side?

65
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:58,439
No.

66
00:06:58,439 --> 00:07:00,920
A figure flashed on the balcony just now.

67
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,600
Looked like that guy who came with Xiang, what's his name...

68
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,240
Shen Yu.

69
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,199
Yeah, that's him.

70
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:07,879
There are four of them too,

71
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:09,839
but so far we've only seen three.

72
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,519
Watch out!

73
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:32,120
Sha Lan, Rossi is out.

74
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,759
I'll be at the parking lot soon. Be careful.

75
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:36,560
Let's go.

76
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,040
Good luck.

77
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,279
Buddy, you're out.

78
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,480
Okay.

79
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,360
Wei Tian.

80
00:07:51,439 --> 00:07:53,519
Wei Tian. Wei Tian.

81
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:55,759
Captain, Wei Tian is looking for you.

82
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,720
Is he?

83
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,040
Yeah.

84
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:57,759
I can't reach him.

85
00:07:57,759 --> 00:07:59,720
Wei Tian, looking for me?

86
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:01,759
I...

87
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:04,959
Captain, you're done for the day?

88
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:09,720
Shen Yu, you played dirty!

89
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,920
Fine, just you wait!

90
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,959
This way.

91
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:21,320
Anda, let's go.

92
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,240
Hurry up, let's move.

93
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,200
Hurry!

94
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:22,120
That kid Shen Yu is too slippery.

95
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,600
It's my fault for being careless, too.

96
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:26,519
Luckily, you spotted him today.

97
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,279
Want me to get you a pain-relief patch?

98
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:30,720
No need. This was barely a workout.

99
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:34,279
Captain, is this our debrief for today?

100
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,919
We can't underestimate Zhong An.

101
00:10:38,919 --> 00:10:40,159
We all underestimated them.

102
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,600
We need to do a thorough debrief on today.

103
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,600
I think what happened today...

104
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,399
...was just an accident.

105
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:46,159
An accident?

106
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:47,720
And the reason for this accident...

107
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,639
...is that between the garden and the parking lot,

108
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:52,919
the surveillance cameras failed along that stretch.

109
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:56,519
You can't blame me entirely for the surveillance issue.

110
00:10:59,519 --> 00:11:02,200
Sha Lan, you were in charge of surveillance.

111
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,240
I think...

112
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,320
you're the one being irresponsible to everyone, okay?

113
00:11:08,399 --> 00:11:09,240
What did you say?

114
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,639
Forget it. Pretend I didn't say anything.

115
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,200
All right, thanks.

116
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,200
Anda says

117
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:28,639
she's treating everyone to dinner at Casablanca.

118
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,200
Everyone should go.

119
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:34,039
I'm too tired. Next time.

120
00:11:35,159 --> 00:11:37,399
We lost so badly today.

121
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:39,000
I need to rest and recharge.

122
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,679
I have to make a comeback tomorrow.

123
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:41,759
I need to practice.

124
00:11:42,759 --> 00:11:44,720
Why look at me? I'm definitely going.

125
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,919
Why wouldn't I go if there's good food?

126
00:11:49,799 --> 00:11:51,039
I'm definitely not giving the two of you

127
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:52,320
a chance to be alone together.

128
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:01,440
Just here?

129
00:12:01,919 --> 00:12:03,559
Boss Zuo, you're not being very thoughtful.

130
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,320
You didn't even get us

131
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,799
a couple's booth.

132
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,799
Stop being so picky.

133
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,279
If there's a seat, just sit down.

134
00:12:09,559 --> 00:12:10,440
Save it.

135
00:12:16,159 --> 00:12:18,600
It was our mistake today.

136
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,480
We should make it up to you.

137
00:12:20,559 --> 00:12:21,759
This meal is on me.

138
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:24,720
Why? Didn't she set up this dinner?

139
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:28,320
You really should pay for this meal,

140
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:31,600
to compensate for my mental distress.

141
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,120
But as long as you remember that.

142
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:35,240
Next time. Someone else is treating this time.

143
00:12:35,879 --> 00:12:36,879
No need to be polite.

144
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,240
Don't be polite with me either.

145
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:43,879
This seat was saved nicely for me.

146
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,200
One third wheel really wasn't enough.

147
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,120
So it's Xiang Lai who's treating.

148
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,519
The purpose of my dinner invite

149
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,600
was originally to apologize to Manager An.

150
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,039
After all, pointing a gun at someone

151
00:12:54,039 --> 00:12:55,080
is quite impolite.

152
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:56,799
But then I thought about it,

153
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:59,799
she wasn't the only one frightened today.

154
00:13:02,759 --> 00:13:03,960
So I'm apologizing to everyone.

155
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:07,279
We were too careless today.

156
00:13:08,919 --> 00:13:10,679
We'll reflect properly on it when we get back.

157
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:14,759
Reflect on it properly.

158
00:13:15,679 --> 00:13:17,639
Still, losing to us at Zhong An

159
00:13:17,799 --> 00:13:19,120
is nothing to be ashamed of.

160
00:13:20,039 --> 00:13:20,799
We, the Silent Protectors,

161
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:22,440
don't give up that easily.

162
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:23,759
Isn't this just the first round?

163
00:13:23,759 --> 00:13:25,120
There are plenty more rounds ahead.

164
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,399
Just seeing what you're made of first.

165
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:29,360
Fine. Since you put it that way,

166
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,159
we'll go all out in the second round.

167
00:13:31,879 --> 00:13:33,519
If you lose to Zhong An again,

168
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,159
I guess the Silent Protectors' pride

169
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:36,240
will take quite a hit.

170
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,120
All right, all right.

171
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,279
Aren't we just here to eat?

172
00:13:39,639 --> 00:13:41,879
I heard the food at Casablanca is great.

173
00:13:41,879 --> 00:13:43,159
I don't want to waste it.

174
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,639
Boss!

175
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,519
Coming!

176
00:13:50,919 --> 00:13:52,399
I heard you have new dishes.

177
00:13:52,399 --> 00:13:53,120
That's right.

178
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,320
Our restaurant recently launched

179
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:56,200
African-style Chinese cuisine.

180
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,279
Would you like to give it a try?

181
00:13:57,679 --> 00:13:59,879
Sure, bring us a Sichuan-style steak.

182
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:00,840
Coming right up!

183
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,679
Make it four orders.

184
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:04,559
Got it!

185
00:14:04,799 --> 00:14:06,320
Boss, one is enough.

186
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:08,279
Four! Four! Four!

187
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,080
Thank you! Please come again!

188
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,480
Where are you going? I'll give you a ride.

189
00:14:13,679 --> 00:14:14,480
Back to the hotel?

190
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:18,240
Let him take you. Sorry for the trouble.

191
00:14:18,519 --> 00:14:19,320
Let's go.

192
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:21,639
Let's go.

193
00:14:23,159 --> 00:14:23,960
Goodbye.

194
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,159
Bye.

195
00:14:30,519 --> 00:14:32,159
Walking for so long, are you tired?

196
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,000
Not really.

197
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:36,200
Actually, if it weren't for you,

198
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,759
I wouldn't dare walk on the streets.

199
00:14:38,879 --> 00:14:40,799
Okay, then I'll stay with you till the end.

200
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:43,080
Where else do you want to go? I'm with you tonight.

201
00:14:43,519 --> 00:14:44,320
Wait for me.

202
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,000
Thank you.

203
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,039
This is for you.

204
00:15:07,399 --> 00:15:08,200
It's so pretty.

205
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,440
Sorry about that.

206
00:15:31,919 --> 00:15:33,080
I planted a tracker on you.

207
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,519
Let's see where you run now.

208
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,159
Hurry, come look!

209
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,559
They're gonna kiss! They're gonna kiss!

210
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,000
What?

211
00:15:50,919 --> 00:15:52,639
Do you think they actually kissed?

212
00:15:53,759 --> 00:15:54,639
What's there to see?

213
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:57,279
Look, he's not dodging this time.

214
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,679
What's so interesting about that?

215
00:16:10,879 --> 00:16:11,919
Where are you going?

216
00:16:12,279 --> 00:16:14,480
Done training. I'm thirsty, getting some water.

217
00:16:15,759 --> 00:16:16,759
Thirsty...

218
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:45,039
You're still up?

219
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,159
I didn't dare sleep.

220
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,679
Were you waiting up for me?

221
00:16:54,559 --> 00:16:55,519
You know full well

222
00:16:55,519 --> 00:16:58,480
how chaotic Antilocaris is at night.

223
00:17:00,679 --> 00:17:01,480
I'm sorry.

224
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,039
It's okay.

225
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:04,880
Get some rest.

226
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:22,559
Round Two: Protect the valuable asset.

227
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,559
Protect the valuable asset?

228
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,640
Then why bring me here?

229
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:31,960
What's this?

230
00:17:32,559 --> 00:17:34,359
You're still playing the VIP.

231
00:17:34,759 --> 00:17:36,039
Inside the hand grip you're holding,

232
00:17:36,039 --> 00:17:37,279
important intel is hidden.

233
00:17:37,799 --> 00:17:39,440
Zhong An is tasked with protecting it.

234
00:17:40,119 --> 00:17:41,920
We, the Silent Protectors, aren't VIPs.

235
00:17:42,039 --> 00:17:43,279
Our job is to seize the intel.

236
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:46,960
There's no danger of being attacked this time, right?

237
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,119
It's hard to say right now.

238
00:17:50,119 --> 00:17:51,519
After all, there are no weapon restrictions.

239
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:53,000
But I can't tell you too much,

240
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,559
or it'll reveal our plan.

241
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:56,960
Have fun.

242
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:58,559
We'll see each other soon.

243
00:18:10,079 --> 00:18:10,880
What are you doing?

244
00:18:11,279 --> 00:18:12,720
Our mission officially starts now.

245
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:15,279
Sometimes, on special missions,

246
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,079
we have to pose as a couple.

247
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:19,319
It helps us avoid suspicion

248
00:18:19,319 --> 00:18:21,119
and offers the best close protection.

249
00:18:21,279 --> 00:18:24,039
What plan? What protection?

250
00:18:27,599 --> 00:18:28,400
Don't worry.

251
00:18:29,519 --> 00:18:31,119
I won't be like those amateurs,

252
00:18:31,119 --> 00:18:32,200
all crude and rough.

253
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:33,000
Let's go.

254
00:18:34,599 --> 00:18:36,400
But I'm not that easy!

255
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,079
How about this one? Does it look good?

256
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:04,880
Looks good. Try it on.

257
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,200
This one looks nice.

258
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,480
The last one looked better.

259
00:19:24,119 --> 00:19:25,640
True. This one's a bit loud.

260
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,640
Doesn't really suit her.

261
00:19:32,079 --> 00:19:34,000
Rossi, don't you think

262
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,960
Xiang Lai actually has pretty good taste?

263
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,680
Look at the dress he picked for Anda.

264
00:19:37,759 --> 00:19:39,119
It looks so classy.

265
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,279
It's really pretty.

266
00:19:46,119 --> 00:19:47,400
We're here to work,

267
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,799
not talk about fashion.

268
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:52,599
Look at this one. This one looks great.

269
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:54,160
This looks gorgeous.

270
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:55,359
This one is really nice.

271
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:56,839
Xiang Lai's sense of style

272
00:19:56,839 --> 00:19:58,920
is way better than a certain someone's.

273
00:19:59,039 --> 00:19:59,839
Over the past seven years,

274
00:19:59,839 --> 00:20:01,799
the clothes he bought me were just...

275
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:03,599
Right. Xiang Lai's great.

276
00:20:03,599 --> 00:20:05,240
Why don't you go work for Zhong An?

277
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:05,920
Don't you think?

278
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,279
That'd be so much more convenient.

279
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:09,119
I was just making casual conversation.

280
00:20:09,119 --> 00:20:11,279
It's not like I named any names.

281
00:20:11,279 --> 00:20:12,279
Besides, the mall isn't even

282
00:20:12,279 --> 00:20:13,359
within our designated zone.

283
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:19,160
Actually, making a move in a mall isn't easy.

284
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,559
It's crowded,

285
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:23,519
but there are surveillance cameras everywhere.

286
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:26,920
That only increases Zhong An's odds,

287
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,279
putting us at a disadvantage.

288
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,759
If the drill rules didn't

289
00:20:31,359 --> 00:20:33,599
require taking the VIP to various venues,

290
00:20:33,799 --> 00:20:36,599
I bet the two of them could shop all day.

291
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:40,200
This tactic isn't very clever.

292
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:42,880
It's such a waste of money.

293
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,920
Looks like they're heading to a French restaurant.

294
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,480
We might have our chance now.

295
00:21:18,759 --> 00:21:19,559
Don't worry.

296
00:21:19,839 --> 00:21:21,519
With me by your side, you're safe.

297
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:32,480
Here's your menu.

298
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:34,680
Here's your menu.

299
00:21:34,759 --> 00:21:35,200
Thank you.

300
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,039
See what you'd like.

301
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:41,599
Their escargot in red wine is really good.

302
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,039
What would you like to drink?

303
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:56,799
Their red wine

304
00:21:56,799 --> 00:21:58,279
is all flown in from Bordeaux.

305
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:02,319
Sounds good.

306
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,240
Waiter!

307
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,400
Wei Tian, do you copy?

308
00:22:15,519 --> 00:22:16,640
It's now confirmed that

309
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,599
there's a driver in the car by the entrance.

310
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:20,039
Nothing unusual in the surrounding area.

311
00:22:20,039 --> 00:22:20,920
How's it looking on your end?

312
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,720
Nothing unusual here.

313
00:22:24,119 --> 00:22:27,119
They're ordering steak and red wine.

314
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,359
Isn't your mouth watering?

315
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:32,599
Doesn't matter if I am.

316
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:34,000
Why do I detect

317
00:22:34,559 --> 00:22:36,440
such a strong hint of jealousy?

318
00:22:40,359 --> 00:22:43,799
Sha Lan, execute Plan A.

319
00:22:44,079 --> 00:22:44,880
Move out.

320
00:22:45,079 --> 00:22:46,039
Copy that.

321
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:51,599
Rossi, what's your status?

322
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:54,480
I'm all set over here.

323
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,759
It's just that this outfit

324
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:59,079
feels a bit uncomfortable.

325
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:10,920
You look really sharp today, sis.

326
00:23:11,599 --> 00:23:12,839
Almost didn't recognize you.

327
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:15,279
Rossi.

328
00:23:15,559 --> 00:23:16,400
Don't engage.

329
00:23:16,720 --> 00:23:17,599
Leave immediately.

330
00:23:33,759 --> 00:23:35,200
How is it? Is the steak good?

331
00:23:38,119 --> 00:23:39,279
What was that just now?

332
00:23:42,319 --> 00:23:43,160
I don't know either.

333
00:23:44,519 --> 00:23:45,559
Let's just eat our steak.

334
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,799
Get in.

335
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:57,039
Drinking such great wine,

336
00:24:57,599 --> 00:24:58,920
eating this delicious steak,

337
00:24:59,599 --> 00:25:00,680
and with the gorgeous Anda

338
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:01,519
having lunch together...

339
00:25:02,759 --> 00:25:04,279
today couldn't be more perfect.

340
00:25:05,599 --> 00:25:06,680
Smooth talker.

341
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:09,200
How many girlfriends have you had?

342
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:13,920
Digging into my past already, huh?

343
00:25:27,039 --> 00:25:27,839
Understood.

344
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:30,920
I'm really sorry, Anda.

345
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,599
The drill was unilaterally called off.

346
00:25:32,599 --> 00:25:33,880
You're safe now. I'm heading out.

347
00:25:40,519 --> 00:25:42,240
Our drill is on hold for now.

348
00:25:42,799 --> 00:25:44,400
First, separate the personal from the professional,

349
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:45,359
and then we'll continue.

350
00:25:46,039 --> 00:25:47,160
Don't tell me

351
00:25:48,079 --> 00:25:49,279
you have personal feelings

352
00:25:49,839 --> 00:25:50,960
for our VIP.

353
00:25:51,079 --> 00:25:52,599
I keep business and personal strictly separate.

354
00:25:52,839 --> 00:25:54,359
Our contest has only just begun.

355
00:25:59,640 --> 00:26:01,759
Xiang Lai from Zhong An Africa branch, reporting.

356
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:03,880
Make it brief.

357
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:05,799
In a couple of days,

358
00:26:06,599 --> 00:26:08,359
I'm coming to Antilocaris.

359
00:26:09,640 --> 00:26:10,480
You're coming here?

360
00:26:10,759 --> 00:26:11,559
What?

361
00:26:12,079 --> 00:26:12,920
Am I not allowed to?

362
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:15,440
Of course you are.

363
00:26:16,759 --> 00:26:18,920
So the incoming VIP...

364
00:26:18,920 --> 00:26:19,880
wouldn't happen to be you?

365
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:22,400
No, I'm not the VIP.

366
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:24,400
But I'll be arriving with them.

367
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:29,319
You're escorting the VIP in person?

368
00:26:29,519 --> 00:26:31,200
This must be a top-priority mission.

369
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,279
Grade A-plus?

370
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,319
Don't ask questions you shouldn't.

371
00:26:34,599 --> 00:26:36,079
Have you forgotten company protocol?

372
00:26:36,519 --> 00:26:37,319
Understood.

373
00:26:37,559 --> 00:26:39,079
The high-speed rail is of critical importance.

374
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:41,079
The issues involved are very complex.

375
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:44,319
Knowing too much won't do you any good.

376
00:26:46,079 --> 00:26:48,680
You must take this matter seriously.

377
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:51,119
There can't be the slightest slip-up.

378
00:26:51,599 --> 00:26:52,400
Understood.

379
00:26:52,839 --> 00:26:54,839
Didn't we sign

380
00:26:54,839 --> 00:26:56,440
a security agreement with Plato Hotel?

381
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:58,400
Yes, this is the Africa branch's

382
00:26:58,400 --> 00:26:59,880
biggest win recently.

383
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:01,880
The VIP guest we're protecting

384
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:03,519
will be staying at Plato Hotel.

385
00:27:03,759 --> 00:27:04,960
Zhong An's operation

386
00:27:06,359 --> 00:27:08,200
cannot afford a single mistake.

387
00:27:08,839 --> 00:27:10,559
Nothing must go wrong.

388
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:11,680
Is that clear?

389
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:13,839
Understood. Mission will be accomplished!

390
00:27:23,240 --> 00:27:24,720
President Xiao! President Xiao!

391
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:27,039
President Xiao! President Xiao!

392
00:27:27,359 --> 00:27:27,960
Your phone.

393
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:38,279
Yes. Right, right, right.

394
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,920
Understood. Don't worry.

395
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:51,400
What's wrong? Fight with your wife?

396
00:27:52,559 --> 00:27:54,319
Worse than a fight with my wife.

397
00:27:56,839 --> 00:27:57,880
Dan Feng is coming.

398
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:14,920
President Dan is arriving today.

399
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:16,039
No one can drop the ball.

400
00:28:16,039 --> 00:28:17,359
We must be proactive,

401
00:28:17,359 --> 00:28:18,519
and keep everything spotless.

402
00:28:18,519 --> 00:28:19,839
Did you hear me? Understood?

403
00:28:19,839 --> 00:28:20,599
Understood!

404
00:28:21,720 --> 00:28:22,960
Hai Bin and Nan Sheng, stay behind.

405
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:23,839
The rest of you, get to work.

406
00:28:27,599 --> 00:28:28,680
So, Hai Bin...

407
00:28:28,839 --> 00:28:30,519
I'll be counting on you over the next few days.

408
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:33,000
Add more variety to the dishes,

409
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:34,960
and prepare some more local food.

410
00:28:36,359 --> 00:28:38,240
But those items...

411
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:39,599
aren't on our menu.

412
00:28:40,319 --> 00:28:41,599
They're just snacks, after all,

413
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:43,359
not part of a formal cuisine.

414
00:28:45,039 --> 00:28:46,519
We're running a hotel here.

415
00:28:46,519 --> 00:28:49,079
How can we not serve any local food?

416
00:28:51,319 --> 00:28:53,720
Is President Dan really as terrifying as you say?

417
00:28:55,319 --> 00:28:57,559
Have you seen that fashion She-Devil?

418
00:29:09,519 --> 00:29:12,000
She's that, magnified a hundred times.

419
00:29:14,480 --> 00:29:16,200
I've worked with her for so many years.

420
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:18,079
She takes good food very seriously,

421
00:29:18,079 --> 00:29:19,599
so you can't drop the ball.

422
00:29:20,799 --> 00:29:22,200
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

423
00:29:22,400 --> 00:29:23,880
I'll pull out all the stops.

424
00:29:24,799 --> 00:29:26,200
Nan Sheng, check it over with me.

425
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:26,480
Okay.

426
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:26,720
Nan Sheng.

427
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:28,799
Wait a second.

428
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:31,319
Remind the staff again

429
00:31:32,440 --> 00:31:33,599
that every single corner

430
00:31:33,839 --> 00:31:34,960
must be spotless.

431
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:36,240
Did I miss anything else?

432
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:38,279
No, everything's in order.

433
00:31:40,119 --> 00:31:41,160
After working for so long,

434
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:43,559
I've never stayed in a room this luxurious.

435
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:45,920
As for President Dan...

436
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:47,119
I really hope this time

437
00:31:47,119 --> 00:31:48,519
she won't nitpick so much.

438
00:31:48,519 --> 00:31:49,880
This room is reserved for her.

439
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:52,880
If she can still find fault with this room,

440
00:31:53,519 --> 00:31:56,480
she's truly impossible to please.

441
00:32:00,119 --> 00:32:02,640
I have a feeling something's about to happen.

442
00:32:03,480 --> 00:32:05,680
You're jumping at shadows now, aren't you?

443
00:32:07,279 --> 00:32:08,440
I hope it's just my imagination.

444
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:09,799
It definitely is.

445
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:13,599
Word is Plato Hotel's in for some trouble.

446
00:32:16,119 --> 00:32:19,000
Plato Hotel's security contract...

447
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:20,400
Wasn't it awarded to Zhong An?

448
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:21,640
Things should settle down.

449
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:25,400
This is just the calm before the storm.

450
00:32:26,559 --> 00:32:27,960
Zhong An Security Group

451
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:29,799
snatched Bito Security Company's contract

452
00:32:29,799 --> 00:32:30,680
right out of their hands.

453
00:32:31,359 --> 00:32:32,359
Can Bito Security Company

454
00:32:32,359 --> 00:32:33,799
really just take this lying down?

455
00:32:35,039 --> 00:32:36,799
Their "gentleman" boss, Kwame,

456
00:32:37,079 --> 00:32:38,559
doesn't have a good temper at all.

457
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:42,519
Don't be fooled by his appearance.

458
00:32:42,799 --> 00:32:45,119
He studied in China in his early days,

459
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:47,640
so he knows a thing or two about the rules.

460
00:32:48,079 --> 00:32:50,240
I think he'll definitely show some attitude,

461
00:32:50,799 --> 00:32:52,440
throw a fit and smash things around.

462
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:53,720
Pretty much.

463
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:55,839
No one's going to get killed.

464
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,319
Where's Wei Tian?

465
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:53,559
This Dan Feng from headquarters...

466
00:33:53,559 --> 00:33:55,480
is a notorious She-Devil.

467
00:33:56,039 --> 00:33:57,240
Extremely harsh.

468
00:33:57,559 --> 00:33:58,480
I heard about that, too.

469
00:33:59,279 --> 00:34:00,440
Did you hide your stuff?

470
00:34:01,119 --> 00:34:02,799
Don't worry, it's hidden.

471
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:05,039
It's a secret recipe passed down from my dad.

472
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:05,920
Let me tell you,

473
00:34:05,920 --> 00:34:06,880
his secret stash of cash

474
00:34:06,880 --> 00:34:08,480
was never once found.

475
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:09,760
Besides,

476
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:13,280
doesn't "She-Devil" start with "she"?

477
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:14,320
As long as she's a woman,

478
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:15,519
there's bound to be a way in.

479
00:34:16,440 --> 00:34:17,159
You got an idea?

480
00:34:17,639 --> 00:34:19,000
Come on, teach me!

481
00:34:21,119 --> 00:34:22,079
Women...

482
00:34:22,239 --> 00:34:22,960
just want to make themselves

483
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:24,360
look pretty.

484
00:34:24,559 --> 00:34:26,719
Take her to a local

485
00:34:26,719 --> 00:34:27,480
specialty spa,

486
00:34:27,599 --> 00:34:29,440
and get her a special skin-whitening package.

487
00:34:30,159 --> 00:34:30,920
Remember,

488
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:33,000
flatter her attentively,

489
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:34,920
and she'll definitely think twice as highly of you.

490
00:34:36,159 --> 00:34:36,519
Okay.

491
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:37,599
Good.

492
00:34:46,039 --> 00:34:47,000
She-Devil?

493
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:49,320
You have a lot of nerve.

494
00:34:50,079 --> 00:34:52,960
People here even know about skin whitening?

495
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,440
Here, Nan Sheng.

496
00:34:56,199 --> 00:34:57,920
Try my newly made seafood soup.

497
00:34:59,159 --> 00:35:01,239
It combines French, Spanish,

498
00:35:01,239 --> 00:35:02,639
and local styles into one.

499
00:35:05,079 --> 00:35:05,519
How is it?

500
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:06,800
Hai Bin.

501
00:35:07,079 --> 00:35:08,679
Your cooking is getting better and better.

502
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:10,079
It's delicious!

503
00:35:10,079 --> 00:35:10,440
Delicious?

504
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,280
Then drink some more.

505
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:13,840
How long did it take to make?

506
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:18,679
Front desk and kitchen secretly dating,

507
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:20,280
and taking advantage of the company?

508
00:35:21,239 --> 00:35:22,239
You guys are unbelievable.

509
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,079
We must step up our training

510
00:35:26,480 --> 00:35:27,920
to show the brothers of our Africa branch

511
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:29,480
at their absolute best.

512
00:35:30,719 --> 00:35:31,719
Don't change the subject.

513
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:33,840
Why didn't you come to training today?

514
00:35:34,159 --> 00:35:35,320
I'm at the Plato Hotel.

515
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:37,559
We can't mess up at such a critical moment.

516
00:35:37,679 --> 00:35:39,440
You're just keeping an eye on Anda, aren't you?

517
00:35:40,800 --> 00:35:42,280
Can't hear you! Bad reception!

518
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:43,000
Gotta go, bye!

519
00:35:53,239 --> 00:35:53,840
At ease.

520
00:35:55,159 --> 00:35:55,559
Attention.

521
00:35:57,360 --> 00:35:58,679
Left face.

522
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:01,360
Double time, march.

523
00:36:30,280 --> 00:36:31,599
How did this flowerpot get broken?

524
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:34,000
There should be Zhong An guards

525
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:35,320
patrolling around here.

526
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:36,880
Today, our headquarters

527
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:38,679
sent an executive to check on us,

528
00:36:38,679 --> 00:36:40,519
so President Xiao sent them to pick her up.

529
00:36:42,199 --> 00:36:43,719
Zhong An's people should answer to me.

530
00:36:44,199 --> 00:36:45,760
You'd better stay out of it from now on.

531
00:37:25,760 --> 00:37:27,199
Look at you, Anda.

532
00:37:27,480 --> 00:37:29,519
Slacking off during work hours,

533
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:31,239
flirting around here.

534
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:36,920
Wait here. I'll go check it out.

535
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:45,079
Strange. What's going on?

536
00:37:45,280 --> 00:37:46,760
Calling electrician, calling electrician.

537
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:47,880
The fourth floor lost power.

538
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:48,559
The fourth floor lost power.

539
00:37:48,559 --> 00:37:49,639
Please come take a look.

540
00:37:49,639 --> 00:37:50,800
Please come take a look.

541
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:52,760
Why did the power go out?

542
00:38:02,559 --> 00:38:04,480
Xiao Zhang, Xiao Zhang, switch on the backup power.

543
00:38:10,280 --> 00:38:11,559
Isn't doing this going a bit too far?

544
00:38:12,079 --> 00:38:14,559
This is none of your business. You're a Silent Protector.

545
00:38:14,639 --> 00:38:16,159
This is between us and the hotel.

546
00:38:16,679 --> 00:38:18,599
Too many people are involved in this game.

547
00:38:18,599 --> 00:38:19,599
Stay out of it.

548
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:29,079
Why didn't you stop him?

549
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:30,960
It has nothing to do with me.

550
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:33,039
Did you do that on purpose because of the competition?

551
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:34,920
You're overthinking it.

552
00:38:36,119 --> 00:38:38,239
Wei Tian, you clearly could have stopped him,

553
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,199
yet you let him get away.

554
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:40,519
Do you just want to see me make a fool of myself?

555
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:44,559
Zhong An is in charge of the hotel's security.

556
00:38:45,079 --> 00:38:46,440
It's not really my job,

557
00:38:46,639 --> 00:38:48,199
nor is it my responsibility.

558
00:38:58,599 --> 00:38:59,159
Wei Tian.

559
00:39:03,320 --> 00:39:03,679
Let's go.

560
00:39:19,599 --> 00:39:21,119
Yang Di, get the electrician over here.

561
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,719
Right away, Manager An. I'll see to it.

562
00:39:25,159 --> 00:39:27,280
Anda, get back here quick. President Dan is here.

563
00:39:27,639 --> 00:39:28,440
President Dan?

564
00:39:28,719 --> 00:39:29,800
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

565
00:39:32,639 --> 00:39:34,960
You go ahead. I'll wait for the electrician here.

566
00:39:48,079 --> 00:39:50,360
Long time no see, Anda.

567
00:39:51,000 --> 00:39:52,039
President... President Dan.

568
00:39:52,320 --> 00:39:53,119
You arrived so early.

569
00:39:53,119 --> 00:39:54,800
Why didn't you let me know in advance?

570
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:56,719
Why? Is there a problem?

571
00:39:57,480 --> 00:39:58,119
No.

572
00:39:58,119 --> 00:40:00,559
I just arranged a car to pick you up.

573
00:40:00,559 --> 00:40:01,119
I was worried...

574
00:40:01,119 --> 00:40:01,840
All right.

575
00:40:02,159 --> 00:40:02,920
Just have someone go to the airport

576
00:40:02,920 --> 00:40:04,480
and bring my luggage back.

577
00:40:05,480 --> 00:40:06,559
Sure. Um...

578
00:40:06,559 --> 00:40:08,360
Why don't you come with me to the restaurant first?

579
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:09,880
I arranged a welcome dinner for you.

580
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:14,599
Notify everyone. Meeting right now.

581
00:40:28,159 --> 00:40:28,960
Tell me.

582
00:40:29,679 --> 00:40:31,400
What's the problem with our hotel right now?

583
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:37,800
President Dan, I'll speak my mind then.

584
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:40,760
Overall, our hotel is actually pretty good.

585
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:41,440
However, after conducting

586
00:40:41,440 --> 00:40:43,320
some thorough market research,

587
00:40:43,320 --> 00:40:44,679
I found a major problem.

588
00:40:45,159 --> 00:40:46,239
It's that our hotel

589
00:40:46,239 --> 00:40:48,400
hasn't integrated well into the local culture.

590
00:40:48,400 --> 00:40:49,159
On the other hand,

591
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:51,199
local hotels are run by locals,

592
00:40:51,199 --> 00:40:52,519
and they do a great job with this.

593
00:40:52,519 --> 00:40:53,960
That's our biggest gap.

594
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:56,280
Fine. Then tell me,

595
00:40:56,840 --> 00:40:58,880
what determines a hotel's standards?

596
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:00,440
What is the key factor?

597
00:41:02,679 --> 00:41:03,480
Details.

598
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:05,719
Exactly. Details.

599
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:08,880
When it comes to a hotel's success,

600
00:41:09,039 --> 00:41:10,679
the details are what matter most.

601
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:14,039
Yet as a hotel manager,

602
00:41:14,599 --> 00:41:16,440
you don't even pay attention to details.

603
00:41:17,360 --> 00:41:18,480
Are you even fit for the job?

604
00:41:28,800 --> 00:41:30,360
Yang Di.

605
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:32,079
President Dan.

606
00:41:32,599 --> 00:41:35,079
The one who called me "She-Devil" behind my back...

607
00:41:35,400 --> 00:41:36,239
was you, wasn't it?

608
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:39,840
No way! How could I?

609
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:42,320
President Dan, you're so approachable, so perfect.

610
00:41:42,320 --> 00:41:43,119
How would I ever dare?

611
00:41:43,119 --> 00:41:43,960
Cut the act.

612
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:51,800
Look at you all.

613
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:54,840
Broken fixtures in the hotel aren't repaired,

614
00:41:55,320 --> 00:41:57,199
and shattered flowerpots are left on the floor.

615
00:41:57,920 --> 00:41:59,039
I'm really curious:

616
00:42:00,039 --> 00:42:03,159
what goes through your heads every day?

617
00:42:04,199 --> 00:42:05,639
It's a good thing the board decided

618
00:42:06,039 --> 00:42:07,320
to send me here to inspect.

619
00:42:08,519 --> 00:42:10,559
With the way things are right now,

620
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:13,280
how do you expect to host the incoming VIPs?

621
00:42:17,239 --> 00:42:18,920
With your current security capabilities,

622
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:21,559
you can't even catch a petty thief.

623
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:23,639
How can I count on you to protect

624
00:42:23,639 --> 00:42:25,480
the personal safety of my guests?

625
00:42:26,039 --> 00:42:28,320
Xiang Lai, your performance today

626
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:29,760
makes me seriously question

627
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:31,320
Zhong An's security capabilities.

628
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:32,239
President Dan,

629
00:42:33,119 --> 00:42:33,960
based on the varying

630
00:42:33,960 --> 00:42:35,679
security risks of each protectee,

631
00:42:35,920 --> 00:42:37,079
we will provide you with

632
00:42:37,079 --> 00:42:38,400
a comprehensive security plan.

633
00:42:38,840 --> 00:42:40,239
We won't let you down.

634
00:42:40,360 --> 00:42:42,440
Fine. I'll be waiting.

635
00:43:13,880 --> 00:43:15,039
Back so soon?

636
00:43:18,679 --> 00:43:19,920
Don't tell me you really went to Plato Hotel

637
00:43:19,920 --> 00:43:20,880
just to look around?

638
00:43:21,119 --> 00:43:22,320
Didn't you already know?
